        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 6651, Single Cylinder Arched Mansion Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in satin nickel or black finishes, the Weslock Mansion Single Cylinder Handleset features graceful arched plates. No matter which of the finishes you choose, the Mansion handleset will add a touch of simple richness to your doors. The beveled edges paired with the curved handle are a picture of elegance and subtle beauty. Easy to install, the Mansion Entryset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches. There is an optional thick door kit that will accommodate doors with thicknesses from 2 inches to 2-1/4 inches. It will adjust to fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior. An ANSI rated grade 2 lock, this outside trim handleset made by Weslock not only looks fantastic, it is made with the attention to quality Weslock is known for.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the knob operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/arched-mansion-dummy-handleset-weslock-6655-6605\"><b>Mansion Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis traditional handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\"><b>Weslock Elegance Collection</b></a> which features lifetime finish and mechanical warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Arched Mansion Single Cylinder Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI A 156.2 grade 2 lock standards.</li>\r\n<li>5-pin cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latches with removable faceplates.</li>\r\n<li>1 inch throw deadbolt with two hardened steel rollers to prevent sawing.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard doors preparations with 2-1/8\" (1-5/8\" optional) top and 2-1/8\" bottom cross holes and 1\" edge hole and a 5-1/2\" center to center cross hole spacing.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Elegance Collection Mansion Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/4\" to 2\" with optional thick door kit for doors 2\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for  2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplates.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arched Mansion Single Cylinder Handleset, Weslock 6651",
                "description": "Arched Mansion Single Cylinder Handleset - Available in satin nickel or black finishes, the Weslock Mansion Single Cylinder Handleset features graceful arched plates. Easy to install, the Mansion Entryset will fit door thicknesses from 1-3/4 inches to 2 inches. There is an optional thick door kit that will accommodate doors with thicknesses from 2 inches to 2-1/4 inches. It will adjust to fit doors with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. A single cylinder handleset, the deadbolt is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior; while the latchbolt underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior. An ANSI rated grade 2 lock, this outside trim handleset made by Weslock not only looks fantastic, it is made with the attention to quality Weslock is known for.",
